        <mxCell id="c62" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;b&gt;CROSS-CUTTING (all nodes)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;State&lt;/b&gt;: TypedDict of Pydantic models; ids/hashes for big payloads; reducers on parallel keys&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Node contract&lt;/b&gt;: decorator enforces typed in/out, status not exceptions, timing + usage logging&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Checkpointer&lt;/b&gt;: async SQLite (thread_id = run_id) enables interrupt/resume + replay&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Blobs + events&lt;/b&gt;: content-addressed payloads; event store per node/LLM/tool/GitHub call; cost NULL when unknown&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Caching&lt;/b&gt;: fetch/retrieval keyed on commit SHA + issue updated_at; LLM calls by input hash&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Failure policy&lt;/b&gt;: retrievers return status (ok/empty/skipped/error), never crash the run; warnings flow to HITL&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Budgets&lt;/b&gt;: per-node timeouts, token + $ caps, tool-call caps; breach = pause for human&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Policy&lt;/b&gt;: path deny-list at fetch (6, 9, 11) and in the validator (18); secret redaction (12, tool results)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Principle 9&lt;/b&gt;: repo conventions outrank harness preferences&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Untrusted input&lt;/b&gt;: issue/comments/docs are DATA, not instructions; planner tools are read-only, no network&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Providers&lt;/b&gt;: LLMClient only (Fireworks/OpenRouter first); no agent CLI needed&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Observability&lt;/b&gt;: eval = context recall vs. files in historical merged PRs (cog eval run)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;spacing=8;">
          <mxGeometry x="1060" y="270" width="340" height="450" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c63" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;b&gt;LOOP LIMITS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• clarify (14): 1 round&lt;br&gt;• gap resolution (16): ≤ 2 rounds&lt;br&gt;• validator repair (18→15): ≤ 3 retries, then escalate to HITL with errors shown&lt;br&gt;• LLM review (19): 1 pass, blocks only on critical&lt;br&gt;• HITL reject (21→15): unbounded, human-driven&lt;br&gt;• schema repair inside LLMClient: small fixed number of attempts&lt;br&gt;• budget breach (any node): pause for human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;PAUSE REASONS (cog resume)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;clarify (14) · review (21) · validation_failed (18) · budget" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;spacing=8;">
          <mxGeometry x="1060" y="740" width="340" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
